                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I kickstarted this, and finally started playing it. While it's compelling, it crashes OFTEN. A game that crashes this much has no excuse to not autosave constantly as a defense.\n\nAnd that's devastating, because I keep losing tons of progress.\n\nI also occasionally softlock because the game just decides all inputs are irrelevant.\n\nDev, please have an autosave feature that triggers with each screen change, or every 2 or 3 screen changes. I lost so much progress because there's nowhere to save except the house!",
